msgid "Cluster-level resources {#cluster-level-resources}"
msgstr "Recursos a nivel de clúster {#cluster-level-resources}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here, we demonstrate how utilizing 128 threads on a cluster allows us to "
"propagate through a more substantial portion of this larger circuit when "
"limited to the same compute time as our laptop.\n"
msgstr ""
